              "question": "Match List I with List II. List I: A. Determining which known organism a specimen represents; B. Grouping organisms using shared characters; C. The study that explicitly incorporates evolutionary relationships into organismal diversity. List II: 1. Identification; 2. Classification; 3. Systematics. Choose the correct mapping.",
