              "question": "Match List I with List II. List I: A. The division producing megaspores from a megaspore mother cell; B. The typical fate of three of the four gymnosperm megaspores; C. The gymnosperm with male and female cones on the same tree in the textbook. List II: 1. Meiosis; 2. Pinus; 3. They degenerate. Choose the correct mapping.",
