              "question": "Match List I with List II. List I: A. The gymnosperm with male and female cones on the same tree in the textbook; B. The gymnosperm with male and female reproductive structures on separate plants; C. The usual agent transferring gymnosperm pollen to exposed ovules. List II: 1. Cycas; 2. Wind; 3. Pinus. Choose the correct mapping.",
